{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu16", "cards": [{"id": "u1.t.organism", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">OR<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">gan<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ism<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"organism\" data-audio=\"audio/organism.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: organism\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"organism\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"32\" cy=\"46\" rx=\"20\" ry=\"10\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"44\" r=\"2\" class=\"f7\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">bacterium<\/text><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"46\" rx=\"24\" ry=\"13\" class=\"f1\"/><path d=\"M124 46 L142 34 L142 58 Z\" class=\"f1\"/><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"43\" r=\"2\" class=\"f7\"/><text x=\"105\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">fish<\/text><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"36\" class=\"\"/><ellipse cx=\"160\" cy=\"44\" rx=\"11\" ry=\"5\" class=\"f3\"/><ellipse cx=\"180\" cy=\"36\" rx=\"11\" ry=\"5\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">plant<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">each one = 1 organism<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Any single living thing, such as a bacterium, a plant or a fish.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>生物体<\/b>：任何一个独立的生命个体，比如细菌、植物或鱼。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">An organism is &quot;organized&quot;: its parts work together as one being.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">organism 就是「有组织的个体」：各部分协作成一个整体。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Is a mushroom an organism?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Yes. A fungus is a living thing.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.cell", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">CELL<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"cell\" data-audio=\"audio/cell.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: cell\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"cell\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"66\" rx=\"72\" ry=\"40\" class=\"f1 k\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"58\" r=\"20\" class=\"f4 k\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"61\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">nucleus<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"11\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">cell membrane<\/text><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"13.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"25.0\"/><polygon points=\"100.0,25.0 97.8,20.5 102.2,20.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">cytoplasm<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The smallest unit that can carry out all the functions of life.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>细胞<\/b>：能完成生命全部功能的最小单位。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Robert Hooke named cells after &quot;cella&quot; (small room) because they looked like tiny rooms.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">胡克看到的小格子像小房间（cella），所以叫 cell。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What is the smallest unit of life?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">The cell.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.homeostasis", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">ho<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">me<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">STA<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">sis<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"homeostasis\" data-audio=\"audio/homeostasis.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: homeostasis\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"homeostasis\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"62\" ry=\"38\"/><polygon points=\"149.0,36.3 137.8,35.3 143.0,26.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><polygon points=\"138.7,90.0 144.6,80.5 149.9,89.0\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><polygon points=\"51.0,83.7 62.2,84.7 57.0,93.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><polygon points=\"61.3,30.0 55.4,39.5 50.1,31.0\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"70\" y=\"8\" width=\"60\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"20.2\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Body too<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"29.4\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">warm<\/text><rect x=\"132\" y=\"46\" width=\"60\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"162\" y=\"62.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Sweating<\/text><rect x=\"70\" y=\"84\" width=\"60\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"100.8\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Body cools<\/text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"46\" width=\"60\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"58.2\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Back to<\/text><text x=\"38\" y=\"67.4\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">normal<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Keeping the inside of the body steady even when the outside changes.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>稳态<\/b>：外界变化时，身体内部保持相对稳定。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">homeo- = similar, -stasis = standing still. A similar state kept.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">homeo- = 相似，-stasis = 静止：保持相近的状态。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Why do you sweat when you are hot?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">To cool down and keep a steady body temperature (homeostasis).<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.metabolism", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">me<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">TAB<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">o<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">lism<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"metabolism\" data-audio=\"audio/metabolism.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: metabolism\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"metabolism\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Food and<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">oxygen<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">in<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"58.05\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Chemical<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"68.25\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">reactions<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Energy<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">and<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">wastes<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">out<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">All the chemical reactions in a cell that build molecules or release energy.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>新陈代谢<\/b>：细胞内所有合成物质或释放能量的化学反应。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Meta = change. Food is changed into energy.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">meta = 改变：食物被转变成能量。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Does a living cell use energy?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Yes. Metabolism uses and releases energy all the time.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.stimulus", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">STIM<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">u<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">lus<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"stimulus\" data-audio=\"audio/stimulus.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: stimulus\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"stimulus\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"55\" r=\"14\" class=\"f6\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"28\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"82\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"11\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"3\" y2=\"55\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"49\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"57\" y2=\"55\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"7.738095238095237\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">bright light<\/text><line x1=\"62.0\" y1=\"55.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"55.0\"/><polygon points=\"100.0,55.0 95.5,57.2 95.5,52.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><ellipse cx=\"140\" cy=\"55\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"22\" class=\"f3\"/><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"55\" r=\"8\" class=\"f7\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">eye detects it<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A change in the surroundings that an organism can detect.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>刺激<\/b>：生物能够察觉到的环境变化。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Plural: stimuli. A stimulus &quot;stings&quot; you into action.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">复数 stimuli。stimulus 像「刺」一下让你行动。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name one stimulus that a plant detects.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Light (also gravity, water or touch).<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.response", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">re<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">SPONSE<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"response\" data-audio=\"audio/response.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: response\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"response\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Stimulus<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">hand touches a hot<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">pan<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Response<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">hand pulls away<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">What an organism does after it detects a stimulus.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>反应<\/b>：生物察觉刺激后做出的行为或变化。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A response always follows a stimulus: stimulus first, response second.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">先有刺激（stimulus），后有反应（response）。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: A sunflower turns toward the sun. What is the stimulus?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Light from the sun.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.reproduction", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">re<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">pro<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">DUC<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"reproduction\" data-audio=\"audio/reproduction.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: reproduction\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"reproduction\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Asexual<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">one parent,<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"8.834586466165414\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">identical offspring<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Sexual<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"8.834586466165414\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">two parents, varied<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">offspring<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Making new organisms of the same kind.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>繁殖<\/b>：产生同类的新个体。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">re- = again, produce = make. Make again.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">re- = 再，produce = 制造：再制造出新个体。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which type of reproduction needs only one parent?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Asexual reproduction.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.growth-and-development", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">GROWTH<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">and<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">de<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">VEL<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">op<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ment<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"growth and development\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: growth and development\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"growth and development\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Seed<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Seedling<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Adult<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">plant<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Growing bigger and changing form as an organism moves through its life.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>生长与发育<\/b>：个体变大，并随生命历程改变形态。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Growth = bigger. Development = changed. A tadpole does both.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">生长 = 变大；发育 = 变样。蝌蚪两者都有。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: A tadpole becomes a frog. Is that growth or development?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Development (a change in form), along with growth.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u1.t.unicellular", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">u<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ni<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">CEL<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">lu<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">lar<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"unicellular\" data-audio=\"audio/unicellular.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: unicellular\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"unicellular\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"100\" cy=\"48\" rx=\"40\" ry=\"30\" class=\"f3 k\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"48\" r=\"11\" class=\"f4\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">DNA<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">cell membrane<\/text><line x1=\"100.0\" y1=\"14.0\" x2=\"100.0\" y2=\"18.0\"/><polygon points=\"100.0,18.0 97.8,13.5 102.2,13.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">1 cell = the whole organism<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Made of only one cell.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>单细胞的<\/b>：整个生物只由一个细胞构成。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">uni- = one. One-cell-ular.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">uni- = 一：只有一个细胞。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Is a bacterium unicellular?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Yes. It is one cell.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u1.t.organism", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Any single living thing, such as a bacterium, a plant or a fish.”<\/i>", "opts": ["organism", "growth and development", "kingdom", "binomial nomenclature"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>organism<\/b>: Any single living thing, such as a bacterium, a plant or a fish. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">生物体<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.cell", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The smallest unit that can carry out all the functions of life.”<\/i>", "opts": ["organ", "reproduction", "cell", "binomial nomenclature"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>cell<\/b>: The smallest unit that can carry out all the functions of life. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">细胞<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.homeostasis", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Keeping the inside of the body steady even when the outside changes.”<\/i>", "opts": ["Bacteria", "prokaryot