a", "ecosystem", "phylum", "growth and development"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>growth and development<\/b>: Growing bigger and changing form as an organism moves through its life. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">生长与发育<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u1.t.unicellular", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Made of only one cell.”<\/i>", "opts": ["derived characteristic", "organism", "unicellular", "phylogeny"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>unicellular<\/b>: Made of only one cell. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">单细胞的<\/span>", "whys": null}]}